        <!-- Document Sections -->
        <div class="space-y-8 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
          
          <!-- 1. Introduction -->
          <section class="space-y-2">
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 text-white inline-flex items-center justify-center text-xs">1</span>
              <span>Introduction</span>
            </h2>
            <p>
              This website operates as an online platform that enables manufacturers, suppliers, dealers, service providers, contractors, professionals, and other third-party sellers to publish, advertise, display, and promote their products and services.
            </p>
            <p>
              The platform provides digital space for sellers to showcase their offerings and connect with potential customers. Unless expressly stated otherwise, the platform does not manufacture, own, sell, or directly provide products or services listed by independent third-party sellers.
            </p>
            <p>
              By accessing or using this website, or by registering as a seller and publishing any content, you agree to comply with these Terms &amp; Conditions and the applicable laws of India.
            </p>
          </section>

          <!-- 2. Copyright Ownership -->
