              <li>Use product photographs, descriptions, logos, videos, and other submitted materials to operate and promote the seller's listings.</li>
              <li>Display seller content in search results, category pages, advertisements, promotional campaigns, newsletters, and social media channels to promote the platform or the relevant listing.</li>
              <li>Resize, format, compress, or make technically necessary adjustments to uploaded content without materially altering its meaning.</li>
