            </p>
            <p class="font-semibold text-slate-800">Prohibited content includes, but is not limited to:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-slate-600">
              <li>Photographs, videos, graphics, or product catalogues copied without authorisation.</li>
              <li>Logos, trademarks, or brand identities used without appropriate permission.</li>
              <li>Product designs, drawings, architectural plans, or technical documents published without the necessary rights.</li>
              <li>Descriptions or promotional material copied from competitors or other websites without permission or another lawful basis.</li>
              <li>Counterfeit products, unauthorised replicas, or misleading representations of branded products.</li>
              <li>Content that violates applicable intellectual property laws or court orders.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>
