              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 text-white inline-flex items-center justify-center text-xs">6</span>
              <span>Seller Representations and Warranties</span>
            </h2>
            <p>By publishing a product or service listing, each seller represents and warrants that:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-slate-600">
              <li>The seller has the legal authority to offer the advertised product or service.</li>
              <li>The seller owns or is authorised to use all submitted content.</li>
              <li>The listing does not knowingly infringe the intellectual property rights of another person or entity.</li>
              <li>The information provided is accurate, lawful, and not materially misleading.</li>
              <li>The seller holds the licences, registrations, certifications, and approvals required for its business and products, wherever applicable.</li>
              <li>The seller will comply with all applicable laws, regulations, product standards, and consumer protection requirements.</li>
            </ul>
