              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 text-white inline-flex items-center justify-center text-xs">8</span>
              <span>Reporting Copyright Infringement</span>
            </h2>
            <p>
              Any copyright owner, authorised representative, trademark owner, or other affected party may submit a written complaint concerning content allegedly infringing their rights.
            </p>
            <p class="font-semibold text-slate-800">The complaint should include:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-slate-600">
              <li>Full name and contact details of the complainant.</li>
              <li>Identification of the copyrighted work, trademark, or other protected material.</li>
              <li>The exact URL or location of the allegedly infringing listing.</li>
              <li>Evidence of ownership or authority to represent the rights holder.</li>
              <li>An explanation of the alleged infringement.</li>
              <li>A declaration that the information provided is accurate to the best of the complainant's knowledge.</li>
              <li>Any additional documents reasonably required to assess the complaint.</li>
            </ul>

            <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-5 text-xs space-y-1.5 my-3">
              <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-wider text-[11px]">Copyright Complaints Contact</div>
              <div><span class="text-slate-500">Email:</span> <a href="mailto:netzeromart@gmail.com" class="font-bold text-blue-600 hover:underline">netzeromart@gmail.com</a></div>
              <div><span class="text-slate-500">Subject Line:</span> <span class="font-semibold text-slate-800">Copyright Infringement Complaint</span></div>
            </div>

            <p>
              The platform will review complaints and take appropriate action in accordance with applicable law. Depending on the circumstances, this may include requesting clarification, restricting access to the content, removing the listing, suspending the seller, or referring the matter to the appropriate authority.
            </p>
            <p>
              Submitting a complaint does not automatically establish infringement. The platform may request additional evidence before taking a final decision.
            </p>
          </section>

          <!-- 9. Repeat Infringers -->
          <section class="space-y-2">
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 text-white inline-flex items-center justify-center text-xs">9</span>
              <span>Repeat Infringers</span>
            </h2>
            <p>
              The platform may suspend or terminate the accounts of sellers who repeatedly publish infringing content or otherwise violate applicable intellectual property laws.
            </p>
            <p>
              Depending on the seriousness of the violation, the platform may remove individual listings, restrict seller privileges, suspend an account temporarily, or permanently terminate access.
            </p>
            <p>
              Where appropriate, the platform may preserve relevant records and cooperate with lawful requests from competent authorities.
            </p>
          </section>

          <!-- 10. Product Listings and Advertising Rights -->
