              <li>Creates a material legal, security, or reputational risk for the platform.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>
              Where appropriate and legally permissible, the seller may be notified of the action and given an opportunity to respond or provide supporting documents.
            </p>
            <p>
              The platform may restore content if the complaint is withdrawn, adequately resolved, or determined to be unfounded, subject to applicable law.
