            </p>
            <p>
              Subject to mandatory statutory requirements and the jurisdiction of competent courts and authorities, disputes relating to these Terms &amp; Conditions shall be subject to the jurisdiction of the courts at Indore.
            </p>
            <p>
              Nothing in this clause limits any rights or remedies that consumers or other parties may have under applicable law.
