            </p>
            <p>
              Continued use of the platform after the effective date of an update will be subject to the revised terms to the extent legally permissible.
            </p>
            <div class="mt-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-blue-50/70 border border-blue-200 text-blue-900 font-medium">
